SUMMARY:American Heart Month
DESCRIPTION:February is American Heart Month. A joint resolution of Congres
 s approved December 30\, 1963\, asks the president to proclaim it every ye
 ar\, and Lyndon B. Johnson proclaimed the first\, for February 1964\, the 
